    {
        "id": "dbgbusycomment001",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "7fceb9f3fadf4c8d",
        "name": "REJECTED_BUSY test",
        "info": "첫 메시지가 flow에서 lock을 잡은 상태로 두 번째 메시지를 즉시 보내면 REJECTED_BUSY 확인 가능",
        "x": 200,
        "y": 1570,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
        "id": "dbginjbusy001",
        "type": "inject",
        "z": "7fceb9f3fadf4c8d",
        "name": "BUSY test start",
        "props": [
            {
                "p": "payload"
            }
        ],
        "repeat": "",
        "crontab": "",
        "once": false,
        "onceDelay": 0.1,
        "topic": "",
        "payload": "{\"equipment_id\":\"CNC-01\",\"command_type\":\"power\",\"value\":true,\"timeout_sec\":15}",
        "payloadType": "json",
        "x": 200,
        "y": 1610,
        "wires": [
            [
                "dbgbusyfunc001"
            ]
        ]
    },
    {
        "id": "dbgbusyfunc001",
        "type": "function",
        "z": "7fceb9f3fadf4c8d",
        "name": "make busy pair",
        "func": "const base = Date.now();\nconst first = RED.util.cloneMessage(msg);\nfirst.payload = Object.assign({}, msg.payload, {command_id: 'demo-busy-first-' + base});\nconst second = RED.util.cloneMessage(msg);\nsecond.payload = Object.assign({}, msg.payload, {command_id: 'demo-busy-second-' + base});\nreturn [first, second];",
        "outputs": 2,
        "noerr": 0,
        "initialize": "",
        "finalize": "",
        "libs": [],
        "x": 410,
        "y": 1610,
        "wires": [
            [
                "dbglinkout001"
            ],
            [
                "dbgdelay001"
            ]
        ]
    },
    {
        "id": "dbgdelay001",
        "type": "delay",
        "z": "7fceb9f3fadf4c8d",
        "name": "send second after 100ms",
        "pauseType": "delay",
        "timeout": "10",
        "timeoutUnits": "milliseconds",
        "rate": "1",
        "nbRateUnits": "1",
        "rateUnits": "second",
        "randomFirst": "1",
        "randomLast": "5",
        "randomUnits": "seconds",
        "drop": false,
        "allowrate": false,
        "outputs": 1,
        "x": 630,
        "y": 1645,
        "wires": [
            [
                "dbglinkout001"
            ]
        ]
    },
    {
        "id": "dbgtimeoutcomment001",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "7fceb9f3fadf4c8d",
        "name": "TIMEOUT simulation",
        "info": "실 writer를 멈추지 않고 timeout 처리 로직만 점검하려면 watchdog로 가는 가짜 command를 주입한다.",
        "x": 180,
        "y": 1710,
        "wires": []
    },
    {
        "id": "dbginjtimeout001",
        "type": "inject",
        "z": "7fceb9f3fadf4c8d",
        "name": "simulate timeout path",
        "props": [
            {
                "p": "payload"
            }
        ],
        "repeat": "",
        "crontab": "",
        "once": false,
        "onceDelay": 0.1,
        "topic": "",
        "payload": "{\"command_id\":\"demo-timeout-1\",\"equipment_id\":\"CAST-01\",\"command_type\":\"power\",\"value\":true,\"status\":\"SENDING\",\"accepted\":true,\"requested_at\":\"2026-06-10T00:00:00.000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-06-10T00:00:00.000Z\",\"retry_count\":0,\"last_error\":null}",
        "payloadType": "json",
        "x": 200,
        "y": 1750,
        "wires": [
            [
                "dbgtimeoutprep001"
            ]
        ]
    },
    {
        "id": "dbgtimeoutprep001",
        "type": "function",
        "z": "7fceb9f3fadf4c8d",
        "name": "prime timeout test",
        "func": "const c = msg.payload || {};\nconst inflightMap = flow.get('equipment_inflight_map') || {};\ninflightMap[c.equipment_id] = {command_id:c.command_id, command_type:c.command_type, started_at:new Date().toISOString(), timeout_sec:10};\nflow.set('equipment_inflight_map', inflightMap);\nconst statusMap = flow.get('command_status_map') || {};\nstatusMap[c.command_id] = Object.assign({}, c);\nflow.set('command_status_map', statusMap);\nmsg.command = {command_id:c.command_id, equipment_id:c.equipment_id, command_type:c.command_type, value:c.value, timeout_sec:10};\nmsg.topic = c.command_id;\nreturn msg;",
        "outputs": 1,
        "noerr": 0,
        "initialize": "",
        "finalize": "",
        "libs": [],
        "x": 430,
        "y": 1750,
        "wires": [
            [
                "dbgtrigger001"
            ]
        ]
    },
    {
        "id": "dbgtrigger001",
        "type": "trigger",
        "z": "7fceb9f3fadf4c8d",
        "name": "fake watchdog 2s",
        "op1": "",
        "op2": "timeout",
        "op1type": "nul",
        "op2type": "str",
        "duration": "2",
        "extend": false,
        "overrideDelay": false,
        "units": "s",
        "reset": "COMPLETED",
        "bytopic": "topic",
        "topic": "topic",
        "outputs": 1,
        "x": 640,
        "y": 1750,
        "wires": [
            []
        ]
    },
    {
        "id": "dbgcommentinspect001",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "7fceb9f3fadf4c8d",
